    {
      "id": "158d6552-404c-40ac-91de-8982a1cde7ec",
      "title": "Passe pelos dois cartões e observe quem está incluído em cada próximo passo.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ea283c48-a48f-4598-b7b8-152a4d6ee4c7",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Ahora voy a descansar en casa.</strong></p><p>Use <strong>voy a</strong> quando o próximo passo é só da pessoa que fala.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/86d9ac3a48b841dd81c1719b45a329de_b01-ahora-voy-a-descansar-en-casa.mp3?Expires=1794099546&Signature=g3huqJz-7GiWhoGngkzPhEMNU6GrDg-rwc4tjdncTnom059VHTCiK8tuySZXnuRTYC8qyDNcADdcsDv74Cr3uztxmFqtz~xJuJV474kfFz2urxARr-cF2yq3eale-FHc8LTED56xU5~j9runIcTngUjBf6QrWE57OOrIAKEyEElfVMsOhg-6FciyxykMHPnkCdDukg4NLOAGFkGHYBDQxhLn6GqLMXF1qKWVuWTsow6BDa0u9-OpV5Ld3IOJ1xm7XWyPfnvFtmjx0fCgg4Inp~NjapAGyDmowVY4SVPwKIwXfEidS-6n9j4eqobGCSOX6xh-JX~c9hYs65SAJgC7Tg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "038384a0-1b2e-431b-872d-3f06eab05289",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Esta noche vamos a cenar juntos.</strong></p><p>Use <strong>vamos a</strong> quando o plano inclui a pessoa que fala e mais alguém.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6d7d03a386534ddc946c2c5417c890f0_b03-esta-noche-vamos-a-cenar-juntos.mp3?Expires=1794099546&Signature=gu2bbKPY2-sgWeWjwWDXNz1mLEh0xfFCqHjTXghQYIs~ZlySdCsOpDIscAluvZu8P1qYJNqZuvFmghAogUXgk~1u4sB9mozE8TRc5WodDkO5tJeJ4mMBFuw7RKoV1mCBD4Sx6~sXNT5aYBzw8VTLhlwhyXww~BW2esOrN-9VGeGRhPsFsKTpsYAbDVqgRBJKTIffS6FZRHjejm9MFg22vomlawnY2D1oh6AZTNinTEwh5GUBMqSaedX~fagvloJOk1cWixLbpbKKq422MywErDh1s--wIojcayQfcUzJyI-YEvrkygZrrHBgFF3cCMoEgv5Z3KlbD~-u-zQcRIcMLQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
